# Third-party licenses

This document lists the Rust crates this build of Unmei contains — third-party
crates plus Unmei's own published library crates — the license chosen for each
one, and the full text of every license used. It is generated from `Cargo.lock` by
[cargo-about](https://github.com/EmbarkStudios/cargo-about) through
`packaging/about.toml`; do not edit it by hand.

Unmei's own code is licensed under the MIT license, shipped in the `LICENSE`
file beside this document.

